\f1\fs22 Agent Ajent Jones jumped from the gunship while it was still half a metre from landing, particle pistol trained on Hayley Lanning. He seemed to slide towards her as he walked, his weapon perfectly level. Hayley and Dr Kathy Logan raised their hands as high as their abdomens and presented their palms out; their gazes darted between the PAPER agent\'92s weapon and his transfixing eyes.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Detective Superintendent Lanning,\'92 Agent Jones called. \'91You will come with me.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The mansion\'92s gates opened and a tank rolled out with its gun aiming at the landed PAPER gunship. The six Elvi guards took up positions flanking Kathy and Hayley. One of them squinted at Agent Jones. \'91Hey! That\'92s the narc who shot up the 
\f2\i Memphis Mafia Bar
\f1\i0 !\'92\
