<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Agent Jones snarled at the insult of being called
\f2\i  officer
\f1\i0 . He was a secret service agent. The twinkle in the guard\'92s eye told Agent Jones the slight was intended. Agent Jones chose to let the guard live, for now. \'91I will apprehend Detective Superintendent Lanning,\'92 he told the guard, \'91and you will stay out of it.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The guard swished his poncho and adjusted his sunglasses. \'91You best be moving right along, officer. Your attempt to kidnap the Holy Momma at the 
