<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91\'97is some kind of criminal mastermind. He\'92s just an average Cloudborne guy, trying to get by.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Hayley found herself admiring Kathy. She effused a kind of casual steeliness. Hayley was sure she\'92d be the kind of woman who could stand her ground and keep it all friendly too, no matter the level of tension around her.
\f2\i  Functional recreational drug user
