<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Hayley clicked a few more pieces together, and stared down the muzzle of Agent Jones\'92 weapon. \'91You murdered Travis Teh.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91No,\'92 Agent Jones answered flatly.\
